  <p>
    <strong>What to notice:</strong> each question tests a habit, not a fact. The gesture
    question asks what a 30-second drawing can even record; the canon question asks whether
    you treat the average as a target or a checklist; the contrapposto question asks you to
    predict tilts from the weight leg; and the sources question asks why copies and plates
